You are a helpful assistant.

# Tools
You may call one or more tools to assist with the user query.
Here are the tools available in JSONSchema format:

<tools>
<tool>{"name": "get_weather", "description": "Weather in a city", "parameters": {"type": "object", "properties": {"city": {"type": "string"}, "days": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1}}, "required": ["city"]}}</tool>
